{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.mp4?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plush Rangers</strong> is a fast-paced auto battler where you assemble a team of <strong>Plushie Friends</strong> to battle quirky mutated enemies and objects. Explore the diverse biomes of <strong>Cosmic Park Swirlstone</strong> and restore <strong>Camp Cloudburst</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each plushie has unique abilities and behaviors\u2014from the defensive <strong>Brocco</strong>, who repels nearby enemies, to <strong>Tangelo</strong>, a charging berserker tortoise. Level up your plushies to boost their power and unlock new capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>6 different characters</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Customize your character with a specialized ranger gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Collect 50+ unique plushies</i></strong> - Each plushie has a different ability.\u00a0 Level them up to discover new synergies between your plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Achieve 150+ badges</i></strong><i> -</i>\u00a0Each badge unlocks additional content, challenges, or improved capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Discover 75+ relic artifacts</strong> -</i> Relics provide bonuses and abilities during your run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/bc0abdbed8c2ae565d945457c902d6e0.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=801 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/bc0abdbed8c2ae565d945457c902d6e0.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593330?t=1749673470","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593330?t=1749673470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/50d7febe7dd310303d6a2b3f929e2a02dc6253f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749673470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/50d7febe7dd310303d6a2b3f929e2a02dc6253f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749673470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.poster.avif?t=1749673470\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593330/extras/8c77aaf8329c596c2e4112af6e9f595d.webm?t=1749673470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse